{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港版《悠長假期》即將播出，Anson Kong挑戰飾演表面玩世不恭的角色「黃子樂 Zero」，為觀眾帶來強烈反 …</p><p></p>\n<p>港版《悠長假期》即將播出，Anson Kong挑戰飾演表面玩世不恭的角色「黃子樂 Zero」，為觀眾帶來強烈反差感。在最新釋出製作特輯中，他親自解構為角色注入當代香港年輕文化元素，看似瀟灑的花花公子，其種種出人意表行為背後竟埋藏住不可告人秘密。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951985508229204_4514239006b008e57347cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"7f3d7b7e-b334-4ef2-b8a5-2de49f7fb5ad.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951985508229204_4514239006b008e57347cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>《悠長假期》Zero鏡頭前後反差大展現內心稚氣</h2>\n<p>在第5集製作特輯中，Anson Kong分享參演港版《悠長假期》點滴。他所飾演「黃子樂 Zero」與Ali的「黃子男」是姐弟，外貌設定與原著相近，給予大眾一種不正經且猶如花花公子般錯覺。雖然鏡頭前展現出極度瀟灑一面，但他指出角色內心深處其實極度渴望被愛，猶如一個長不大童心未泯小朋友。拍攝現場片段可見他表現非常幽默，不時與對手演員開玩笑，將活潑跳脫特質發揮極致。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855288271286_21194228586b008e5948f25.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"47a6a5f9-e692-4264-9792-1342b5f17652.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855288271286_21194228586b008e5948f25.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>夥拍導演重新審視劇本為角色注入當代文化</h2>\n<p>為了令角色更加貼地，Anson Kong坦言今次參演是一次極大挑戰。他認為這是一個全新香港版本，現代年輕人愛情觀與生活方式早與當年日本社會背景大相徑庭。因此他選擇與編劇攜手重新審視整個故事脈絡，並為角色進行全面重新設計。他表示雖然原著有值得參考素材，但更多靈感源自與不同對手演員現場互動及與導演深入溝通，為角色塑造出充滿本土氣息全新面貌。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855418561809_20326218826b008e5a83318.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"b86027b5-b7a3-4476-8dd3-a2422c2688d2.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855418561809_20326218826b008e5a83318.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>玩世不恭表象掩飾失去恐懼全因童年經歷</h2>\n<p>對於外界普遍認為角色極度瀟灑，Anson Kong親自拆解這個性格設定背後玄機。他解釋這種漫不經心態度純粹是一種自我保護掩飾：「佢成日都好似好玩世不恭、好唔正經咁樣，其實佢只係好害怕失去。」這種對失去產生極大恐懼心理，原來深深植根於角色一段鮮為人知童年經歷之中。製作團隊特意將這段背景故事隱藏，呼籲觀眾留意正式播出尋找答案。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855605340263_2730584776b008e5c73ecd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"669882b4-91bb-4bac-ae1f-613b9bf71922.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855605340263_2730584776b008e5c73ecd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>原來深深植根於AK角色背後有一段鮮為人知童年經歷。製作團隊特意將這段背景故事隱藏，呼籲觀眾留意正式播出尋找答案。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>AnsonKong破格演出惹熱烈討論期待解開身世謎團</h2>\n<p>製作特輯曝光後隨即引發大批劇迷高度關注，不少觀眾對這段隱藏劇情充滿好奇。社交平台上湧現大量討論聲音，網民紛紛留言表示「好想知Zero童年經歷過咩事」、「表面花心原來內心咁脆弱真係好反差」。大眾對於Anson Kong今次突破過往形象演繹深表期待，認為這種充滿層次感角色設定極具張力。 </p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855768742511_18507790876b008e5e093e7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ccfb9c21-cd00-4c61-b040-f1addc1225bf.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855768742511_18507790876b008e5e093e7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855962719229_15585891936b008e6007297.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"1ed1f750-9536-4b7d-9026-f2a6cd83510f.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179519855962719229_15585891936b008e6007297.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/anson-kong-2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anson-Kong</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%82%a0%e9%95%b7%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">悠長假期</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%af%e5%8a%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港劇</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3547135\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 21 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:56:07.378384+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1379,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T22:16:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T00:37:27.874731+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T23:49:38.191292+00:00","content_hash":"049a50554a50eb98d487c49186c433ec3d7af32f5ac8df44e0247654e94848cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}